# Research output (1H-12 intakes, 1I-10 programmes): hundreds of JSON files full of Korean
# department names and field names that also appear in the code. Kept out of ripgrep (and so
# out of Claude Code's search) to keep code searches clean. Git, the importers and direct reads
# are unaffected; search the data itself with `rg --no-ignore <term> apps/api/prisma/data`.
